<title>BANGLADESH: Ships collide near Bangladesh port.</title>
<headline>Ships collide near Bangladesh port.</headline>
<dateline>CHITTAGONG, Bangladesh 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>A ship carrying 912 Bangladeshi workers deported from Saudi Arabia was in collision with the Indian ship Aditya Usha near Chittagong port, shipping sources said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>No one was injured in the incident on Tuesday, marine department officials said. The forecastle of the Aditya Usha was damaged while the hull of the other vessel, the Panamanian-registered Mecca-1, was dented.</p>
<p>The Bangladeshis were among thousands being deported by Saudi Arabia for travelling with forged documents or staying illegally.</p>
</text>
